      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "-: Whoa, you already learned a lot about routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 9.9,
          "en": "We're nearing the end, but did you ever wonder what happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.9,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "if we enter something here which we don't cover?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 16.86,
          "en": "Like, let's say it's just slash 'something'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.86,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "we get an error, because clearly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 23.22,
          "en": "we don't have a route with slash 'something' here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "So, that is something we probably want to improve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 30.27,
          "en": "We want to do some 404 error handling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.27,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "We maybe want to redirect the user to a specific page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "whenever he tries to visit a page we don't have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "These are the topics I'll focus on next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 42.72,
          "en": "Setting up a route which handles all routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.72,
          "end": 45.96,
          "en": "we don't have set up, and redirecting requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.96,
          "end": 49.38,
          "en": "Not necessarily two topics you use together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.38,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "but also not that uncommon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "So, let's start with redirecting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "Let's say we add a new component to our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 60.3,
          "en": "and I will use the CLI 4 that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.3,
          "end": 63.66,
          "en": "with the GC for generate component command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.66,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "And I'll name it 'page not found'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "the page not found component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 69.93,
          "en": "which was added here in our app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.93,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "In this new page not found folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 75.27,
          "en": "I'll get rid of this back file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.27,
          "end": 78.37,
          "en": "And here I will simply say in the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.28999999999999,
          "end": 83.16,
          "en": "this page was not found. Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.16,
          "end": 85.77,
          "en": "Now I want to render this page in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "let's say, the case that we visit a certain route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 91.71000000000001,
          "en": "I'll add it here at the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 95.97,
          "en": "where the path is, for now, 'something.'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.97,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "And in the 'something' case here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 101.64,
          "en": "I want to load my page not found component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.64,
          "end": 103.2,
          "en": "Of course, make sure that you added it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.2,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "to declarations and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "because we're still using it in our app, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.97,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "So with this in place, if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.57,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "go back to our application and visit slash 'something'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "we of course see this page was not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "Now let's change 'something' to 'not found.'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.64,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "And let's make sure that once we add another new route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "which then is 'something' let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "we don't also have to add component here, but we redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 137.01,
          "en": "to another route, to the not found route, maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 139.44,
          "en": "For this, we get another property we can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.44,
          "end": 141.51,
          "en": "to any route configure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.51,
          "end": 144.36,
          "en": "So, of course, also to any of the other routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "if you don't want to specify a component to load,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "you can say 'redirect to.'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 152.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now this is an alternative to component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 154.8,
          "en": "Component loads the specific component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.8,
          "end": 157.89,
          "en": "Redirect to redirects to another path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.89,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "So here you can specify any path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "and the path maybe now is slash not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "So, now, if you do this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 169.74,
          "en": "you see that it automatically redirected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.74,
          "end": 171.06,
          "en": "So, let me show you this again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.06,
          "end": 174.06,
          "en": "by typing slash 'something' watch the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.06,
          "end": 176.57999999999998,
          "en": "it redirects to slash 'not found'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.57999999999998,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "and all the other routes of course still work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 181.863,
          "en": "So this is how we can use redirection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.73,
          "end": 184.92,
          "en": "Now, of course, it's not very convenient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.92,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "to define slash 'something' here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 190.5,
          "en": "because you probably can't define all possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.5,
          "end": 193.74,
          "en": "wrong URLs the user can enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.74,
          "end": 197.64,
          "en": "So, a more convenient way to catch all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.64,
          "end": 200.01,
          "en": "routes which are not covered by your app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.01,
          "end": 204.12,
          "en": "is to use the double asterisk route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.12,
          "end": 205.71,
          "en": "This is the wildcard route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.71,
          "end": 209.7,
          "en": "which means catch all paths you don't know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 212.55,
          "en": "And the order is super important here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.55,
          "end": 216.93,
          "en": "Make sure that this very generic route is the last one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.93,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "in your array of routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 222.66,
          "en": "because your routes get parsed from top to bottom here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.66,
          "end": 226.32,
          "en": "So, if this was actually at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 226.32,
          "end": 228.12,
          "en": "you would always get redirected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.12,
          "end": 231.6,
          "en": "as I can quickly show you by saving this like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.6,
          "end": 233.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now, no matter where you click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.67000000000002,
          "end": 236.61,
          "en": "you always are redirected to not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.61,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "So make sure this is the last route here in your setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "And with this, now all the other routes work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.89,
          "end": 248.25,
          "en": "But if you enter anything invalid here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.25,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "you always get redirected to 'not found'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "because now you're using this wildcard route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 257.13,
          "en": "catching all routes which are unknown to angler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.13,
          "end": 260.64,
          "en": "at this point of time, once it reaches this line here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.64,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "and which then redirects to the not found route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 267.87,
          "en": "which displays the page not found page or component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.87,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "This is how you can redirect and make sure you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 274.053,
          "en": "catch routes you're not covering right now.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
